  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Using Work energy theorem,</p><p>Kinetic energy&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>d</mo><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math> Joules</p>"
